# Copy to .env and fill in. The .env file NEVER goes into git.

# Who approves. One e-mail, and only one: it is their ✓ that becomes a lock in the repository.
HOLDRIM_OWNER=you@example.org

# No model key. The engine calls no model: what applies a request is the CLI you already have on
# your machine (claude, codex, gemini…), with the account that is logged into it.
